(h)
"post-graduate college" means a University college or an affiliated college situated within the University area and
providing post-graduate courses of study leading up to the post-graduate degrees of the University;
(i)
"prescribed" means prescribed by this Act or the statutes, ordinances or regulations;
(j)
"principal" means the head of a college;
(k)
